{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Railway Robot Rescue Reserve!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been recruited by the <strong>Rail Guard</strong> to defend the isle of <strong>Steamhaven</strong> from the shadowy and mysterious MT-1, and his ever-growing armada of <strong>Railborne</strong> rebels. At your side is your partner and new best friend \u2014 a sentient locomotive that not only speaks, but can transform into a <strong>towering cybernetic titan.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you\u2019ll patrol the island\u2019s tracks, attach convertible <strong>weapon rigs</strong> to your consist, and unleash thunderous robot battles against the steam-driven legions of the <strong>MT-1.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to keep the rails clear of danger, prevent your new friend's firebox from fizzling, and halt the rise of the dreaded <strong>Dark Lord Choochoolhu</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then all aboard, trainee! The time has come for you to rise through the ranks, save the world, and prove yourself as the island\u2019s ultimate ... <strong>Super Conductor!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063540?t=1773425383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063540?t=1773425383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063540/8a9b683616b7efef1bcbda04499b32c28e852073/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773425383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063540/8a9b683616b7efef1bcbda04499b32c28e852073/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773425383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"d